title: macro:save
tags: [[GUI command]] Macros
kind: reference
summary: Save the last recorded macro as a user command, user:<name>

Saves the last recorded [[macro|Macros]] as the user command `user:<name>`: written at the end of `gui/macros.js`, and loaded at once. `user:` may be given or left out. A name already a command, or already in the file, is refused, and so is a file the GUI cannot add to (one no longer ending with the `};` of its export).
